[[0,1416376,0,68,1,67,"2016-11-17T00:53:48","EavanSmith","",[],"","Germans Now Most Concerned About Immigration, Extremism, Worldwide","http://www.breitbart.com/london/2016/11/16/ipsos-research-germans-concerned-immigration-extremism-europe/","news"],[1,6842913,0,7,0,7,"2016-11-17T01:25:19","firex726","[e]",[],"<p>Now they just need another final solution before it happens to them. </p>"],[1,6844397,0,1,1,0,"2016-11-17T04:45:26","Apathy","",[],"<p>Could've saved Germany and the rest of the EU tens of billions and prevented tens of thousands of rapes, not to mention other crimes, if they would have only bothered to listen to me. </p>\n<p>Sometimes you wonder how an entire country, let alone a continent can be so stupid. And then that saying &quot;one person is smart, many people are stupid&quot; starts making sense. Looking at individuals, you start seeing what they're better than you at and you feel intimidated. But when you start looking at the average of many people, they might as well be neanderthals. </p>"],[1,6846992,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-17T15:34:20","beavis","",[],"<p>Too little, too late. &quot;Concern&quot; gets you nowhere when savages from barbarian lands are destroying your civilization, raping your women, taking your houses, making your towns dangerous and murdering your menfolk, and you sit sucking your thumbs for two years. </p>"],[2,6847085,6846992,0,0,0,"2016-11-17T15:47:58","Totenglocke","",[],"<p>Not just sucking their own dicks, but fucking FUNDING it all too.</p>"],[1,6848679,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-17T19:06:39","wgtt911","",[],"<p>Barn door is already closed.. too late.</p>"]]
