[[0,1416379,0,2,0,2,"2016-11-17T00:55:01","BlackLivesMatter111","",[],"<p>People are dying of diseases and starvation, but some of our top doctors and scientists spend their entire lives and countless hours of research toward figuring out how to cut a man's dick off and turn it into a deformed pussy in hopes that one day they can do what actual women do naturally.</p>","It's a shame we live in a world where...","","whatever"],[1,6843022,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-17T01:39:20","brandon816","[e]",[],"<p>To be fair, they are paying customers. Most people suffering from lethal and debilitating diseases and starvation aren't. Sounds like you dislike pure capitalism.</p>"],[1,6844581,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-17T05:28:58","littul_kitton","[e]",[],"<p>I agree. I wholeheartedly support the basic human need of a starving gender-dysphoric man to be turned into a starving woman emulation.</p>\n<p>Do you think it would be better to handle the entitlement payments through WHO or Doctors Without Borders?</p>"]]
