[[0,1416382,0,4,0,4,"2016-11-17T00:55:28","4_am","",[],"<p>I have tried to search the net for the answer, but I can't find anything I trust, especially in light of the media bullshit I've learned about. \nI am a new Trump supporter. I am trying to learn more about him.</p>\n<p>What are his views on essentially paying off politicians through big corporation and special-interest lobbies? </p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>","What is trump's stance on money in politics?","","whatever"],[1,6843226,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-17T02:01:06","pray_the_gay_away","",[],"<p>Actions speak louder than words.</p>\n<p>And he just kicked all the lobbyists out of his whitehouse. </p>"],[2,6844260,6843226,0,0,0,"2016-11-17T04:24:36","4_am","",[],"<p>Really? I'm going to look that up. Thank you!</p>"],[2,6844273,6843226,0,0,0,"2016-11-17T04:26:13","4_am","",[],"<p>&quot;That's the problem with the system -- the system,&quot; Trump said. &quot;We're doing a lot of things to clean up the system. But everybody that works for government, they then leave government and they become a lobbyist, essentially. I mean, the whole place is one big lobbyist.&quot;</p>\n<p>Wow. I am starting to really like him more. I hope he continues to make good decisions like this.</p>"]]
